Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:36:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] EXPERIMENTAL K114s boot trial: admit apple,k114s (k114sap,
 board 0x14) in developer builds

- Engine: k114sap device, 26B8125 stub IPSW row (k114sap identity, mBoot-20457.41.3,
  RestoreLongVersion 26.2.125.8.0,0), board 0x14 gate; BOARD_MACHO k114sap
  (stage1-k114s.{bin,macho}, confined m1n1/boot-ctxr.bin, 27.2); collect k* FUD
  multitouch firmware (port of aurora-installer asahi_firmware/multitouch.py).
  Engine v0.9.2-omarchy.20261114.34c0d271c5f0 (17914560 bytes, sha256 2cc772dd...).
- supported-models: apple,k114s developer board (experimental, never booted).
- MacModelNames: K114s.
- Tests: K114s engine tests; developer board set.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
